+: (`[]string`) A slice of [regular expressions](g) matching the media types of content files and content adapter pages that Hugo is allowed to render. Content with the `text/html` media type is emitted verbatim, so it is denied by default. To allow HTML content from sources you trust, set `allowContent = ['.*']`. Pages with an empty body are not affected.
